e the mechanic outfit  you can purchase from the crazy camp  store is most definitely a reference to  Mario's appearance in famicom gram free  to 3d hot rally both him and Luigi can  be seen wearing the outfit on the game's  promo art patches on the arms are nice  touch too  if you roll on the ground in the sand or  beachside Kingdom your clothes will pick  up some of the dirt it's not one of the  craziest things you can pull off in the  game but it's a nice detail worth  pointing out in multiple kingdoms you'll  often encounter walls with 8-bit art of  both cat Mario and cat Peach these  feline versions of Mario and Peach  should be familiar to those who played  Super Mario 3d World for Wii U using  copy not cat Mario for 10 coins and cat  Peach for heart and there you have it  those were just a few of the non  spoilery Easter eggs and references but  there are tons more so stay tuned to  game spot for more Easter eggs down the  road and if you got some really obscure  ones yourself put them in the comments  below  thanks for watching  [Music]
 

